{"id": "dev000-ja", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法で「婚姻の届出の受理」を定めているのは第747条です。\n\n**第747条（婚姻の届出の受理）**\n婚姻の届出は、届出を受けた市区町村長が、婚姻の要件に欠けることがないことを確認して受理し、婚姻届受理証明書を発行します。ただし、婚姻の要件に欠けることが明らかである場合は、受理しません。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["747"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["747"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 833, "tokens_out": 90, "tokens": 923, "latency_s": 6.515736244000436, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 833, "out": 90, "ms": 6511.074007999923}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev000-en", "item_id": "dev000", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["740"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article is **Civil Code Article 740** (民法 第七百四十条).\n\nIt provides that a marriage registration cannot be accepted unless it is confirmed that the marriage does not violate the provisions of Articles 731, 732, 734 to 736, and other relevant laws.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["740", "731", "732", "734"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["731", "732", "734"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3347, "tokens_out": 164, "tokens": 3511, "latency_s": 10.051551131000451, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 831, "out": 54, "ms": 3389.5980599991162}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1181, "out": 40, "ms": 2220.282022999527}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1335, "out": 70, "ms": 4437.4612089995935}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "婚姻の届出の受理", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "740"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-ja", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責」を定めているのは第1003条です。\n\n**第1003条**：負担付遺贈の受遺者は、遺贈された財産の価額を限度として、遺言者の負担を履行する義務を負う。ただし、受遺者がその財産を既に取得していない場合、または遺言者がその財産を既に取得していない場合を除く。受遺者は、その財産の価額を超過する負担の履行を請求されない。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1003"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 837, "tokens_out": 114, "tokens": 951, "latency_s": 7.791814605001491, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 837, "out": 114, "ms": 7789.910469999086}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev001-en", "item_id": "dev001", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["1003"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article is **Civil Code Article 1002** (第千二条).\n\nIt provides that a beneficiary of a legacy subject to a burden is liable to fulfill the burden only to the extent that the value of the legacy exceeds the burden. If the beneficiary renounces the legacy, they are exempt from liability.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1002"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1002"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2051, "tokens_out": 126, "tokens": 2177, "latency_s": 7.747978331999548, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 835, "out": 59, "ms": 3465.172508998876}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1216, "out": 67, "ms": 4279.134341000827}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "負担付遺贈の受遺者の免責", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-ja", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告」を定めているのは第973条です。\n\nこの条文は、遺贈の受遺者が遺贈の承認または放棄をしない場合、遺言執行者や相続人が受遺者に催告を行うことを定めています。催告を受けた受遺者は、催告から1ヶ月以内に遺贈を承認または放棄しなければならないとされています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["973"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["973"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 839, "tokens_out": 86, "tokens": 925, "latency_s": 5.719195661999038, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 839, "out": 86, "ms": 5717.307716000505}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev002-en", "item_id": "dev002", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["987"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article is **Article 987 of the Civil Code** (民法第九百八十七条).\n\nIt provides that interested parties (including the obligor of a legacy) may demand from the legatee that they decide within a reasonable period whether to accept or renounce the legacy.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["987"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2058, "tokens_out": 119, "tokens": 2177, "latency_s": 8.253367141000126, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 837, "out": 60, "ms": 4041.803403999438}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1221, "out": 59, "ms": 4205.6511899991165}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受遺者に対する遺贈の承認又は放棄の催告", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-ja", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予」を定めているのは、**第360条**です。\n\nこの条文は、抵当権者が抵当建物の使用人に対して引渡しを請求した場合でも、抵当権者がその使用人の引渡しを拒絶する正当な理由があるときは、裁判所がその引渡しを猶予する旨を定めるものです。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["360"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["360"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 837, "tokens_out": 86, "tokens": 923, "latency_s": 5.139100529000643, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 837, "out": 86, "ms": 5137.475821000407}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev003-en", "item_id": "dev003", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["395"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article is **Civil Code Article 395** (民法 第三百九十五条).\n\nIt provides that a person using or deriving income from a mortgaged building under a lease that cannot be opposed to the mortgagee is not required to deliver the building to the purchaser at the auction until six months have passed from the time of the purchaser's acceptance. Exceptions apply if the use began after the acceptance or if the purchaser demands payment for subsequent use and it remains unpaid.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["395"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3481, "tokens_out": 195, "tokens": 3676, "latency_s": 14.270656634000261, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 835, "out": 58, "ms": 3872.9523019992484}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1180, "out": 40, "ms": 2779.269860999193}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1466, "out": 97, "ms": 7613.456643000973}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "抵当建物使用者の引渡しの猶予", "law": "民法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "民法", "article": "395"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-ja", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法において「管理不全土地管理命令」を定めているのは、**第24条**です。\n\nこの条文は、土地の所有者が土地の管理を怠っている場合、市町村長がその土地の管理者を指定し、必要な措置を講じさせることができる旨を定めています。これにより、所有者の管理不全を是正し、公共の福祉や近隣住民の利益を保護することを目的としています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["24"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["24"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 832, "tokens_out": 91, "tokens": 923, "latency_s": 5.854794070000935, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 832, "out": 91, "ms": 5852.997156000129}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev004-en", "item_id": "dev004", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["264-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The article dealing with 「管理不全土地管理命令」is **Article 264-9 of the Civil Code**.\n\nIt provides that when a landowner's management of land is inappropriate and infringes or threatens to infringe upon another's rights or legally protected interests, the court may issue a management order for the land (管理不全土地管理命令) to appoint a manager to handle the land.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["264-9"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 2025, "tokens_out": 137, "tokens": 2162, "latency_s": 8.998810021999816, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 830, "out": 54, "ms": 4392.635834999965}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1195, "out": 83, "ms": 4602.728859999843}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "管理不全土地管理命令", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev005-ja", "item_id": "dev005", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["413"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における「受領遅滞」を定めている条文は、主に**第123条**です。\n\n**第123条**の内容は以下の通りです。\n債権者が債務の履行を請求したにもかかわらず、債務者が履行を拒絶し、かつ債権者がその履行を拒絶したと認められる場合、債務者はその債務を弁済する義務を負うとともに、その債務の履行によって生じた損害について賠償する責任を負う。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["123"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["123"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 831, "tokens_out": 102, "tokens": 933, "latency_s": 6.602079976999448, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 831, "out": 102, "ms": 6600.201107999965}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev005-en", "item_id": "dev005", "arch": "react", "type": "topic", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["413"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The Japanese Civil Code does not contain a single article explicitly titled \"受領遅滞\" (delay in acceptance); rather, the legal concept is defined by the combination of **Article 493** (which states that a debtor must actually offer performance, but if the creditor refuses to accept it in advance, a notice of preparation and demand for acceptance suffices) and **Article 498** (which states that if a debtor must perform, the creditor cannot accept the deposited item without making the required payment). These articles establish the rules governing a creditor's refusal to accept performance, which constitutes the debtor's delay in acceptance.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["493", "498"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["493", "498"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 9, "tool_calls": 8, "tokens_in": 17322, "tokens_out": 516, "tokens": 17838, "latency_s": 34.69149638199997, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 829, "out": 53, "ms": 3848.2354959996883}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1196, "out": 41, "ms": 2696.672979000141}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1393, "out": 57, "ms": 3032.0062699993287}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1756, "out": 41, "ms": 3188.354433999848}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1917, "out": 55, "ms": 3247.8782389989647}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2286, "out": 58, "ms": 3870.6680049999704}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2659, "out": 41, "ms": 2810.8168940016185}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2825, "out": 41, "ms": 1960.4347700005746}, {"node": "react.force", "in": 2461, "out": 129, "ms": 10021.217622999757}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "478"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞 債権者", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "493"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "受領遅滞 定義", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "遅滞 債権者 弁済", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "498"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "497"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev006-ja", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "「子ども・子育て支援金率」を定めたのは健康保険法第百六十条の二です。その直後の条文は第百六十条の三（準備金）です。\n\n**第百六十条の三**は、保険者が健康保険事業の費用支出に備えるため、毎事業年度末に準備金を積み立てなければならないことを定めています。また、協会が健康保険事業の収支見通しに基づき、準備金の積立状況から運営に支障が生ずると見込まれる場合、厚生労働大臣に報告し必要な措置を講ずることも規定しています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5231, "tokens_out": 273, "tokens": 5504, "latency_s": 17.308654242000557, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 841, "out": 56, "ms": 4606.295515000966}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1237, "out": 44, "ms": 2624.1657470000064}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1459, "out": 44, "ms": 2875.4646119996323}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1694, "out": 129, "ms": 7196.60980199842}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-3"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev006-en", "item_id": "dev006", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["160-3"], "anchor": ["160-2"], "answer": "The article immediately after the one on「子ども・子育て支援金率」(Article 160-2) is **Article 160-3 of the Health Insurance Act**.\n\nIt provides that insurers must establish a **reserve fund** at the end of each fiscal year to prepare for expenses related to health insurance operations, as prescribed by government ordinance.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["160-2", "160-3"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5211, "tokens_out": 219, "tokens": 5430, "latency_s": 15.462081679999756, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 836, "out": 56, "ms": 3840.747635998923}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1232, "out": 44, "ms": 4162.860018999709}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1454, "out": 44, "ms": 3250.601743999141}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1689, "out": 75, "ms": 4201.770697000029}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "子ども・子育て支援金率", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "160-3"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-ja", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "刑法における「法律上の減軽と刑の選択」は第25条に定められています。この条文の直後にあるのは第26条です。\n\n第26条の内容は、裁判官が法定刑の範囲内で刑を選択する際に、犯罪の性質や情状を考慮して、より軽い刑を選択できる場合があることを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["25", "26"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["25", "26"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 841, "tokens_out": 77, "tokens": 918, "latency_s": 5.490196851000292, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 841, "out": 77, "ms": 5488.3751180004765}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev007-en", "item_id": "dev007", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["70"], "anchor": ["69"], "answer": "The article on 「法律上の減軽と刑の選択」is Article 69 of the Penal Code. The article immediately after it is **Article 70**.\n\n**Article 70** provides that when a person is sentenced to multiple punishments for different crimes, the punishments shall be combined according to the rules specified in the preceding articles (Articles 68 and 69), and the combined punishment shall be determined.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["69", "70", "68"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["68"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 1, "tokens_in": 1995, "tokens_out": 145, "tokens": 2140, "latency_s": 9.508500758000082, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 837, "out": 56, "ms": 3916.8475039987243}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1158, "out": 89, "ms": 5588.39597000042}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "法律上の減軽と刑の選択", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-ja", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "健康保険法で「資格の得喪の確認」を定めているのは第39条です。その直後の条文は第40条「標準報酬月額」です。\n\n第40条は、被保険者の標準報酬月額を、その報酬月額に基づき等級区分によって定めることを定めています。具体的には、報酬月額に応じて標準報酬月額が決定される等級区分表を掲載しています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 6250, "tokens_out": 222, "tokens": 6472, "latency_s": 17.62220954500117, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 840, "out": 55, "ms": 3415.303407000465}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1213, "out": 41, "ms": 3587.7368780002143}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1525, "out": 41, "ms": 3327.388115998474}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2672, "out": 85, "ms": 7285.44068500014}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "40"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev008-en", "item_id": "dev008", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["40"], "anchor": ["39"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 39 (資格の得喪の確認) in the Health Insurance Act is **Article 40 (標準報酬月額)**.\n\nArticle 40 establishes the standard remuneration monthly amount (標準報酬月額) based on the insured person's actual monthly remuneration, using a specified classification system.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["39", "40"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 6230, "tokens_out": 203, "tokens": 6433, "latency_s": 15.484997154999292, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 835, "out": 55, "ms": 3896.36272899952}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1208, "out": 41, "ms": 2903.48126400022}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1520, "out": 41, "ms": 3115.7497220010555}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2667, "out": 66, "ms": 5563.197204000971}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "資格の得喪の確認", "law": "健康保険法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "39"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "健康保険法", "article": "40"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-ja", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "「譲受会社による債務の引受け」を定めたのは**第二十三条の二**です。その直後の条文は**第二十四条**です。\n\n**第二十四条の内容要約**:\n事業を商人に譲渡・譲受けした場合、商法第16条第1項の譲渡人・譲受人とみなし、同法第17条から第18条の2までの規定を適用する。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23-2", "24", "16", "17", "18-2"], "invalid": ["18-2"], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["24", "16", "17"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 5479, "tokens_out": 232, "tokens": 5711, "latency_s": 18.22146590599914, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 842, "out": 57, "ms": 5710.113110000748}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1220, "out": 42, "ms": 3301.064712999505}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1582, "out": 40, "ms": 2363.6689329996443}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1835, "out": 93, "ms": 6837.6456090009015}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "24"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev009-en", "item_id": "dev009", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["23-2"], "anchor": ["23"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 23-2 (譲受会社による債務の引受け) is **Article 24** of the Companies Act.\n\n**Article 24** provides that if a transferor company transfers its business to a transferee company and the transferee company continues to use the transferor company's trade name, the transferee company is deemed to have assumed the debts incurred by the transferor company in the course of its business, unless the transferee company has publicly announced that it will not assume such debts.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["23-2", "24"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["24"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3629, "tokens_out": 210, "tokens": 3839, "latency_s": 14.704035947001103, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 837, "out": 57, "ms": 4060.4998170001636}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1215, "out": 42, "ms": 3535.8664329996827}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1577, "out": 111, "ms": 7101.36194900042}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "譲受会社による債務の引受け", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "23-2"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev010-ja", "item_id": "dev010", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["485"], "anchor": ["484"], "answer": "民法で「弁済の場所及び時間」を定めているのは第499条です。この条文の直後に置かれているのは第500条です。\n\n第500条の内容は、債権者が弁済を受けようとする場合、債務者がその場所や時間を変更する必要があるかどうかを考慮し、債務者が弁済を拒否した場合の扱いについて規定しています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["499", "500"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["499", "500"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 839, "tokens_out": 84, "tokens": 923, "latency_s": 5.307347882000613, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 839, "out": 84, "ms": 5305.2883869986545}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev010-en", "item_id": "dev010", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["485"], "anchor": ["484"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 484 (弁済の場所及び時間) is **Article 485** of the Civil Code.\n\nArticle 485 provides that, unless otherwise agreed, the costs of performance shall be borne by the debtor. However, if the creditor increases the costs of performance by moving their residence or other acts, the debtor may claim reimbursement for the increased portion.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["484", "485"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 3396, "tokens_out": 179, "tokens": 3575, "latency_s": 13.35185968299993, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 835, "out": 55, "ms": 4520.406871999512}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1192, "out": 41, "ms": 3521.067747999041}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1369, "out": 83, "ms": 5304.9560809995455}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "弁済の場所及び時間", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "484"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev011-ja", "item_id": "dev011", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["97"], "anchor": ["96"], "answer": "民法で「詐欺又は強迫」について定めているのは第96条（取消権）です。この条文の直後に置かれているのは第97条です。\n\n第97条の内容は、詐欺又は強迫によってした意思表示を取り消す場合、その行為人（詐欺者又は強迫者）が相手方（被詐欺者又は被強迫者）に悪意があるときは、第三者に対抗することができないという規定です。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["96", "97"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": [], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 837, "tokens_out": 96, "tokens": 933, "latency_s": 5.513821496999299, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 837, "out": 96, "ms": 5511.374416999388}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev011-en", "item_id": "dev011", "arch": "react", "type": "neighbour", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["97"], "anchor": ["96"], "answer": "The article immediately after Article 747 (詐欺又は強迫による婚姻の取消し) is **Article 748** (婚姻の取消しの効力).\n\nArticle 748 provides that the effect of annulling a marriage is retroactive only for the future. It also states that a party who was unaware of the grounds for annulment at the time of marriage must return property acquired through the marriage up to the extent of their current benefit, while a party who knew of the grounds must return all benefits and may be liable for damages if the other party acted in good faith.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["747", "748"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["747", "748"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 4, "tool_calls": 3, "tokens_in": 4929, "tokens_out": 259, "tokens": 5188, "latency_s": 17.906199306999042, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 833, "out": 53, "ms": 4020.8284059990547}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1184, "out": 41, "ms": 3019.4328489997133}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1354, "out": 41, "ms": 2912.797226999828}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1558, "out": 124, "ms": 7946.558191999429}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "詐欺又は強迫", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "747"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "748"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev012-ja", "item_id": "dev012", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["870", "1015"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における「後見の計算」と「遺言執行者の行為の効果」を定める条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1. **後見の計算**：第923条\n   後見人が管理する財産の計算方法（貸借の清算）について定めています。\n\n2. **遺言執行者の行為の効果**：第1000条\n   遺言執行者が行った行為について、その効果について定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["923", "1000"], "invalid": ["1000"], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["923"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 839, "tokens_out": 97, "tokens": 936, "latency_s": 5.739147049000167, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 839, "out": 97, "ms": 5736.72326200176}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev012-en", "item_id": "dev012", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["870", "1015"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**「後見の計算」:**\n*   **民法 第八百七十条**: 後見人の任務終了後、後見人等は2ヶ月以内に後見の計算をしなければならない。\n*   **民法 第八百七十一条**: 後見の計算は、後見監督人がいる場合はその立会いのもとに行わなければならない。\n*   **民法 第八百七十二条**: 未成年被後見人が成年に達した後、後見の計算終了前にされた契約は、その者が取り消せる。\n*   **民法 第八百七十三条**: 後見の計算終了時から、返還すべき金額には利息を付さなければならない。\n*   **民法 第九百六十六条**: 被後見人が後見の計算終了前に、後見人等の利益となる遺言をした場合は無効とする。\n\n**「遺言執行者の行為の効果」:**\n*   **民法 第千十二条**: 遺言執行者は遺言実現のため必要な行為をする権利義務を有する。\n*   **民法 第千十五条**: 遺言執行者が権限内で行った行為は、相続人に対して直接効力を生ずる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["870", "871", "872", "873", "966", "1012", "1015"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["871", "872", "873", "966", "1012"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 1, "quotes_unsupported": 1}, "run": {"llm_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2, "tokens_in": 2386, "tokens_out": 359, "tokens": 2745, "latency_s": 21.40149724100047, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 838, "out": 108, "ms": 7161.646239001129}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1548, "out": 251, "ms": 14234.797016000812}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "後見の計算", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "遺言執行者の行為の効果", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev013-ja", "item_id": "dev013", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["189", "167"], "anchor": [], "answer": "健康保険法における「審査請求及び再審査請求」は第123条、「保険料の源泉控除」は第124条に定められています。\n\n- **第123条（審査請求及び再審査請求）**：保険者による決定に対して不服がある場合、審査請求を、その決定に対する審査の結果に対して不服がある場合、再審査請求をすることができる旨を定めています。\n- **第124条（保険料の源泉控除）**：保険料の納付に際し、給与等の支払者が保険料を控除して納付する制度（源泉控除）について、その方法や手続きを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["123", "124"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["123", "124"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 843, "tokens_out": 142, "tokens": 985, "latency_s": 8.587650453000606, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 843, "out": 142, "ms": 8585.377422999954}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev013-en", "item_id": "dev013", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "健康保険法", "gold": ["189", "167"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**健康保険法 第189条**: 被保険者の資格、標準報酬、保険給付に関する処分に不服がある者は、社会保険審査官に審査請求し、その決定に不服がある場合は社会保険審査会に再審査請求できる。\n\n**健康保険法 第190条**: 保険料等の賦課・徴収処分や第180条の処分に不服がある者は、社会保険審査会に審査請求できる。\n\n**健康保険法 第167条**: 事業主は、被保険者に報酬や賞与を支払う際、その被保険者が負担すべき保険料を報酬・賞与から控除できる。控除した場合は計算書を作成し、被保険者に通知しなければならない。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["189", "190", "180", "167"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": true, "gold_recall": 1.0, "extra": ["190", "180"], "correct": true, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 6, "tokens_in": 4764, "tokens_out": 442, "tokens": 5206, "latency_s": 27.517145493999124, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 841, "out": 112, "ms": 7576.550501999009}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1582, "out": 168, "ms": 10963.616555000044}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2341, "out": 162, "ms": 8970.347651998964}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "審査請求及び再審査請求", "law": "Health Insurance Act", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "保険料の源泉控除", "law": "Health Insurance Act", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Health Insurance Act", "article": "189"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Health Insurance Act", "article": "190"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Health Insurance Act", "article": "191"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Health Insurance Act", "article": "167"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev014-ja", "item_id": "dev014", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["263", "20"], "anchor": [], "answer": "刑法における「信書隠匿罪」と「没収の制限」に関する条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1. **信書隠匿罪**：第147条\n   - 他人の書信を隠匿し、または破棄して、その権利を害した者は、3年以下の懲役または50万円以下の罰金に処されます。\n\n2. **没収の制限**：第148条\n   - 信書隠匿罪で没収された書信は、所有者の請求があれば返還されます。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["147", "148"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["147", "148"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 837, "tokens_out": 120, "tokens": 957, "latency_s": 8.45225865700013, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 837, "out": 120, "ms": 8450.318946999687}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev014-en", "item_id": "dev014", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "刑法", "gold": ["263", "20"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**刑法 第二百六十三条（信書隠匿）**：他人の信書を隠匿した者は、六月以下の拘禁刑又は十万円以下の罰金若しくは科料に処する。\n\n**刑法 第四十九条（没収の付加）**：併合罪のうち重い罪で没収を科さない場合でも、他の罪で没収の事由があるときは、これを付加することができる。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["263", "49"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.5, "extra": ["49"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 4, "tokens_in": 4136, "tokens_out": 269, "tokens": 4405, "latency_s": 18.07090802899984, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 836, "out": 104, "ms": 7514.092391000304}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1522, "out": 79, "ms": 4547.875803000352}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1778, "out": 86, "ms": 6004.37351400069}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "信書隠匿", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "没収の制限", "law": "刑法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "263"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "刑法", "article": "49"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev015-ja", "item_id": "dev015", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["950", "774-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "会社法における「業務の休廃止」は第457条、「株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用」は第458条に定められています。\n\n- **第457条（業務の休廃止）**：子会社の株式を交付した会社（親会社）が、その子会社の業務を休止または廃止する場合の要件と手続きを定めています。\n- **第458条（準用）**：第457条で定める業務の休廃止に関する規定を、株式交付子会社の株式を譲渡する場合に準用することを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["457", "458"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["457", "458"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 848, "tokens_out": 134, "tokens": 982, "latency_s": 8.135198986999967, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 848, "out": 134, "ms": 8133.063146000495}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev015-en", "item_id": "dev015", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["950", "774-9"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**会社法 第九百五十七条**は、法務大臣が電子公告調査の業務の全部又は一部を自ら行うことができる場合について定めています。\n\n**会社法 第七百七十四条の六**は、株式交付子会社の株式を譲渡しようとする者が、株式交付親会社が株式交付に際して譲り受ける株式交付子会社の株式の総数の譲渡しを行う契約を締結する場合には、前二条（第七百七十四条の四、同条の五）の規定を適用しないことを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["957", "774-6", "774-4"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["957", "774-6", "774-4"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 4, "tokens_in": 4517, "tokens_out": 315, "tokens": 4832, "latency_s": 19.204570280999178, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 846, "out": 116, "ms": 7136.579622001591}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1595, "out": 84, "ms": 5221.547364000799}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2076, "out": 115, "ms": 6837.027405999834}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "業務の休廃止", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "株式交付子会社の株式の譲渡しに関する規定の準用", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "957"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "774-6"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev016-ja", "item_id": "dev016", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "民法", "gold": ["914", "468"], "anchor": [], "answer": "民法における「遺言による担保責任の定め」は第963条、「債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁」は第467条です。\n\n*   **第963条（遺言による担保責任の定め）**：遺言で相続人が被相続人の債務の弁済を担保する責任を負うことを定めた場合、その責任は遺言で定められた範囲に限られます。\n*   **第467条（債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁）**：債権者が債権を譲渡した際、債務者はその債権に対して持っていた抗弁を、譲受人に対しても主張できることを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["963", "467"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["963", "467"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 846, "tokens_out": 147, "tokens": 993, "latency_s": 9.998503985998468, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 846, "out": 147, "ms": 9996.550048001154}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev016-en", "item_id": "dev016", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "民法", "gold": ["914", "468"], "anchor": [], "answer": "The Civil Code articles are:\n\n1. **Article 1016 (遺言執行者の復任権)**: This article deals with the executor's right to delegate duties to third parties, but it does not specifically address \"遺言による担保責任の定め\" (security obligations by will). The exact provision for security obligations by will is not found in the search results.\n\n2. **Article 467 (債権の譲渡の対抗要件)**: This article states that the assignment of a claim is not effective against the debtor or third parties unless the assignor notifies the debtor or the debtor consents.\n\n3. **Article 469 (債権の譲渡における相殺権)**: This article allows the debtor to offset claims against the assignee if they were acquired before the notice of assignment or consent, or under specific conditions.\n\nFor \"遺言による担保責任の定め\", the relevant provision is not clearly identified in the search results. For \"債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁\", Articles 467 and 469 are the primary articles.", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["1016", "467", "469"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["1016", "467", "469"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 5, "tokens_in": 4663, "tokens_out": 471, "tokens": 5134, "latency_s": 28.62357691499892, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 845, "out": 115, "ms": 7279.609328999868}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1574, "out": 124, "ms": 7740.075181000066}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 2244, "out": 232, "ms": 13595.725371000299}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "遺言による担保責任の定め", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "債権の譲渡における債務者の抗弁", "law": "Civil Code", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "1016"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "467"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "Civil Code", "article": "469"}, "ok": true}], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev017-ja", "item_id": "dev017", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "ja", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["805", "400"], "anchor": [], "answer": "会社法における「新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合」と「委員の選定等」を定めた条文は以下の通りです。\n\n1. **新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合**\n   - **第483条**：新設分割計画が、分割する会社と新設会社との株主の議決権の過半数（総株主資本の3分の2以上）に承認された場合、または分割する会社の株主の議決権の過半数（総株主資本の3分の2以上）に承認された場合、新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合を定めています。\n\n2. **委員の選定等**\n   - **第484条**：新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合において、分割する会社と新設会社との株主の議決権の過半数（総株主資本の3分の2以上）に承認された場合、または分割する会社の株主の議決権の過半数（総株主資本の3分の2以上）に承認された場合、新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合を定めています。\n\nこれらの条文は、新設分割の計画の承認に関する手続きを定めています。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["483", "484"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.0, "extra": ["483", "484"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 2, "quotes_unsupported": 2}, "run": {"llm_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 0, "tokens_in": 845, "tokens_out": 267, "tokens": 1112, "latency_s": 16.170681769999646, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 845, "out": 267, "ms": 16168.159843000467}], "tools": [], "verify": [], "errors": [], "prompts": "v1", "model": "qwen3.5:9b (Q4_K_M) via llama.cpp server"}
{"id": "dev017-en", "item_id": "dev017", "arch": "react", "type": "pair", "language": "en", "law": "会社法", "gold": ["805", "400"], "anchor": [], "answer": "**新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合**\n- **第762条**: 新設分割を行う場合、新設分割計画を作成しなければならない。\n- **第763条**: 株式会社を設立する新設分割計画の定めなければならない事項を規定する。\n- **第764条**: 株式会社を設立する新設分割の効力の発生等（新設分割設立株式会社の権利義務の承継）を規定する。\n- **第766条**: 持分会社を設立する新設分割の効力の発生等を規定する。\n\n**委員の選定等**\n- **第400条**: 指名委員会、監査委員会又は報酬委員会の各委員会の組織、委員の選定方法、社外取締役の割合等を規定する。\n- **第401条**: 各委員会の委員の解職、員数の欠けた場合の措置等を規定する。\n- **第417条**: 指名委員会等設置会社の取締役会の運営（指名委員会等がその委員の中から選定する者の取締役会招集権等）を規定する。\n- **第47条**: 設立時取締役の中から設立時代表取締役を選定する事項を規定する。\n- **第342条の2**: 監査等委員である取締役等の選任等についての意見の陳述を規定する。", "status": "answered", "score": {"cited": ["762", "763", "764", "766", "400", "401", "417", "47", "342-2"], "invalid": [], "gold_hit": false, "gold_recall": 0.5, "extra": ["762", "763", "764", "766", "401", "417", "47", "342-2"], "correct": false, "no_citation": false, "quotes": 0, "quotes_unsupported": 0}, "run": {"llm_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 11, "tokens_in": 7278, "tokens_out": 785, "tokens": 8063, "latency_s": 56.24908254699949, "errors": 0, "tool_failures": 0}, "calls": [{"node": "react.agent", "in": 843, "out": 113, "ms": 8557.815287000267}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 1561, "out": 370, "ms": 27617.206406999685}, {"node": "react.agent", "in": 4874, "out": 302, "ms": 20063.34418699953}], "tools": [{"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "新設分割計画の承認を要しない場合", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "search_articles", "args": {"query": "委員の選定等", "law": "会社法", "top_k": 5}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "764"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "762"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "763"}, "ok": true}, {"node": "react", "name": "get_article", "args": {"law": "会社法", "article": "766"}, "ok": true}, {"node"